card.statement:
We have the following formula for $t_j$:

\begin{equation}
t_j=(-1)^{j-1}\Delta^{-1} \sum_{w\in S_n}\sgn(w)w\big(x_1^{n-2}x_2^{n-3}\cdots x_{n-2} e_{n-j}'y_n\big),
\quad\forall j\in\iv{1}{n},
\end{equation}

where $e_d'$ denotes the degree $d$ elementary symmetric polynomial in the variables $x_1,\ldots,x_{n-1}$ and $\Delta=\prod_{1\le i< j\le n} (x_i-x_j)$.
